        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "*(A) IN GENERAL. The requirements of this paragraph are met if –",
            "block_bbox": [
                458,
                247,
                877,
                285
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    458.0,
                    247.0
                ],
                [
                    877.0,
                    247.0
                ],
                [
                    877.0,
                    285.0
                ],
                [
                    458.0,
                    285.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "\"(i) except as provided in clause (ii), each group health plan or arrangement under which applicable health benefits are provided provides that the applicable employer cost for each taxable year during the cost maintenance period shall not be less than the higher of the applicable employer costs for each of the 2 taxable years immediately preceding the taxable year of the qualified transfer; and",
            "block_bbox": [
                457,
                304,
                878,
                431
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    457.0,
                    304.0
                ],
                [
                    878.0,
                    304.0
                ],
                [
                    878.0,
                    431.0
                ],
                [
                    457.0,
                    431.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "\"(ii) in the case of a collectively bargained transfer, each collectively bargained group health plan under which collectively bargained health benefits are provided provides that the collectively bargained employer cost for each taxable year during the collectively bargained cost maintenance period shall not be less than the amount specified by the applicable collective bargaining agreement.\"",
            "block_bbox": [
                458,
                447,
                877,
                573
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    458.0,
                    447.0
                ],
                [
                    877.0,
                    447.0
                ],
                [
                    877.0,
                    573.0
                ],
                [
                    458.0,
                    573.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(7) Subsection (c)(3)(B) of section 420 of such Code is amended by striking \"APPLICABLE\" in the caption and by adding the following flush language at the end of subsection (c)(3)(B):",
            "block_bbox": [
                388,
                585,
                877,
                642
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    388.0,
                    585.0
                ],
                [
                    877.0,
                    585.0
                ],
                [
                    877.0,
                    642.0
                ],
                [
                    388.0,
                    642.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "\"For purposes of this paragraph, the term 'collectively bargained employer cost' means the average cost per covered individual of providing collectively bargained retiree health benefits as determined in accordance with the applicable collective bargaining agreement. Such agreement may provide for an appropriate reduction in the collectively bargained employer cost to take into account any portion of the collectively bargained retiree health benefits that is provided or financed by a government program or other source.\"",
            "block_bbox": [
                458,
                659,
                877,
                835
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 7,
